#
# KelyfOS guest kernel — x86_64 delta.
#
# Artifact: the uncompressed ELF "vmlinux". Firecracker does not boot a bzImage
# on x86_64 — selected in Buildroot with BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_VMLINUX.
#
# Boot arguments (consumed by the CLI at P1-5):
#   reboot=k panic=1 nomodule swiotlb=noforce console=ttyS0 pci=off quiet
#   i8042.noaux i8042.nomux i8042.dumbkbd
# The i8042 knobs stop the kernel probing a PS/2 controller that Firecracker
# does not emulate; they are pure boot-time savings and are x86-only, which is
# the one genuine cmdline difference between the two architectures.
